[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0020","text":"啊～\n好像有甜甜的味道～♡"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0030","text":"是那边的和果子店吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0040","text":"嗯……\n……御手洗团子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0050","text":"啊哈～\n透前辈，名侦探～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0060","text":"……不是矶边饼吗\n有酱油烧焦的味道\n（注：矶边饼为海苔包年糕，涂酱油烤制）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0070","text":"啊……\n那就，选那个吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0080","text":"那～\n去确认一下正确答案吧～♡"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0090","text":"呵呵，好呀\n还早呢，午饭"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0100","text":"……给家里发个消息\n说中午可能做饭"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_01_0102","text":"Motion"}]
